+- `structlog.processors.ExceptionRenderer` (and therefore `structlog.processors.format_exc_info` and `structlog.processors.dict_tracebacks`) and `structlog.processors.ExceptionPrettyPrinter` now handle missing exceptions – for example, when `exception()` is called outside of an exception handler.
